{"id":"W1e917160c14b6ac4babf0702","zh":"Wigner-Ville分布","en":"","name":"Wigner-Ville分布","language":"zh","domain":"轨道不平顺与信号处理","concept_id":"C12e3c2f8631097839cc8","families":[],"definition_zh":"描述信号时间与频率联合能量分布的双线性时频表示。","definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W1e917160c14b6ac4babf0702","text":"Wigner-Ville分布","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S7f8ccdd56368c1536ed4","source_id":"P110","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"为满足铁路轨道不平顺实时监测、时-频特征精细化提取和线路状态评估的需要,本文基于时-频联合分析基本理论,采用时-频能量密度方法描述轨道不平顺的时-频域分布性质,推导Wigner-Ville分布能量密度与轨道不平顺功率谱密度、TQI指标的数学联系,建立融合轨道谱和TQI指标基本物理特性的铁路轨道不平顺时-频能量联合分析方法,并分别从时域、频域和时-频域等角度验证方法的合理性。","citations":[{"source_id":"P110","page":1,"page_end":1}]}],"sources":{"P101":{"id":"P101","title":"基于小波和Wigner-Hough变换的轨道特征不平顺联合分析","authors":"徐磊；陈宪麦","year":"2014","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8360.2014.05.015","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2014）","overview_slug":"2014-wavelet-wigner-hough-track-irregularity"},"P110":{"id":"P110","title":"铁路轨道不平顺的时-频能量联合分析方法","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明","year":"2017","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8360.2017.04.002","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2017）","overview_slug":"2017-time-frequency-energy-joint-analysis-method-for-railway-track-irregularity"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"把信号能量表示在时间与频率的二维平面。","language":"zh","source_id":"P101","paper_slug":"2014-wavelet-wigner-hough-track-irregularity","title":"基于小波和Wigner-Hough变换的轨道特征不平顺联合分析","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"W5a42158f0e2130c1be859b16","name":"Wigner-Ville distribution","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null},{"id":"W6926a1450cdda7609cd967ce","name":"Wigner-Ville distribution (WVD)","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"expressio